            <ArticleTitle>Clinical experiences of using a silver hydroalginate dressing in Austria, Switzerland and Germany.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>384, 386-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This retrospective study, which involved patients with a range of colonised or infected wounds from 12 central European wound-care centres, found that this dressing combated infection, reduced pain and promoted healing.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
